
deegree console https://geo.653080.xyz/deegree/

1. Create a new workspace Identifier:chglj
   Working directory:		/root/.deegree
   copydata to： root/.deegree/chglj/datasources/feature/shapefiles
  
2.Create new feature store  Identifier:yjbhq type:shapefile template:mapped
   modify: <FeatureTypeName>一级保护区</FeatureTypeName>
   modify: <File>./shapefiles/yjbhq.shp</File>
   modify: <Encoding>UTF-8</Encoding>
   modify: <SimpleProperty name="objectid" mapping="ID" /> ID-->objectid 此列值必须为唯一，否则只显示第1个要素

3.Create new service Identifier:yjbhq type:WFS  template:complex
   delete: <Version>1.1.0</Version>
   modify:<FeatureStoreId>yjbhq</FeatureStoreId>
   delete: <QueryCRS>urn:ogc:def:crs:EPSG::4258</QueryCRS>
   add: <GeoJSONFormat>
          <MimeType>application/geo+json</MimeType>
        </GeoJSONFormat>

4. backup chglj workspace files---cd /root/.deegree &zip -r deegree . 

5. publish WFS to arcgisonline 
deegree：copy link from Web services Capabilities	
arcgisonline: add layer from URL

6. arcgisonline  layer 
